{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wufan-e-525e25a311cba7f0d7ce","title":"赵达少从汉侍中单甫受学","accounts":[{"id":"wufan-a-525e25a311cba7f0d7ce","label":"正文","text":"赵达少从汉侍中单甫受学","evidence":["wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0050","role":"受学者","evidence":["wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d"]},{"person":"wufan-p-e243c81c9a7c93","role":"授学之师","evidence":["wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d"]},"ordering_evidence":"wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d","order":10884}],"persons":[{"id":"wufan-p-e243c81c9a7c93","name":"单甫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0050","name":"赵达","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wufan-q-92652a7a47d7f391af9d","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-b1c1bc08a69e5ae5e3e0","layer":"original","quote":"赵达，河南人也〖1〗。少从汉侍中单甫受学，用思精密。谓东南有王者气，可以避难，故脱身渡江。治九宫一算之术〖2〗，究其微旨。是以能应机立成，对问若神；至计飞蝗〖3〗，射隐伏〖4〗，无不中效。","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
